<title>BELGIUM: EU raids SGL Carbon offices.</title>
<headline>EU raids SGL Carbon offices.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union and U.S. anti-trust inspectors have raided the premises of German carbon and graphite maker SGL Carbon as part of a probe into alleged price fixing practices, EU sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
